===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:respounse<ety:bor<fro:respuns>>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|respounse}}, {{m|enm|respons}}, from {{der|en|fro|respons}}, {{m|fro|respuns}}, {{m|fro|responce}}, ultimately from the {{der|en|la|respōnsum}}, a nominal use of the neuter form of {{m|la|respōnsus}}, the perfect passive participle of {{m|la|respondeō}}, from {{m|la|re||again}} + {{m|la|spondeō||promise}}. {{doublet|en|responsum}}.

